  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Photograph of a health worker in a headscarf talking with a woman wearing a face veil across a desk in a clinic; a sign on the wall reads \"From the People of Japan\". It illustrates Box 4.3 on integrating hepatitis C screening into antenatal care in Cox's Bazar, Bangladesh.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "صورة فوتوغرافية لعاملة صحية ترتدي غطاء رأس تتحدث مع امرأة ترتدي نقاباً عبر مكتب في عيادة؛ وعلى الجدار لافتة كُتب عليها \"From the People of Japan\". وتوضح الصورة الإطار 4.3 بشأن إدماج تحرّي التهاب الكبد C في رعاية الحوامل في كوكس بازار، بنغلاديش.",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "照片：诊所内，一名戴头巾的卫生工作者隔着桌子与一名戴面纱的妇女交谈；墙上的标牌写有“From the People of Japan”。该照片配合专栏4.3，介绍在孟加拉国科克斯巴扎尔将丙型肝炎筛查纳入产前保健。",
      "lang": "zh",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fotografía de una trabajadora sanitaria con pañuelo en la cabeza que conversa con una mujer con velo facial a través de un escritorio en un consultorio; un cartel en la pared dice \"From the People of Japan\". Ilustra el recuadro 4.3 sobre la integración del cribado de la hepatitis C en la atención prenatal en Cox's Bazar (Bangladesh).",
      "lang": "es",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Photographie d'une agente de santé portant un foulard qui s'entretient avec une femme voilée de part et d'autre d'un bureau dans un centre de santé ; un panneau au mur indique « From the People of Japan ». Elle illustre l'encadré 4.3 sur l'intégration du dépistage de l'hépatite C dans les soins prénatals à Cox's Bazar (Bangladesh).",
      "lang": "fr",
      "state": "draft",
